# QA (M2 acceptance, D-042/D-047): game over in Brunnwinkl, the last
# playable stage, restarts Brunnwinkl. The run starts at Brunnwinkl from the
# title (level = brunnwinkl, start = title). Three times: the opening of
# qa_m2_coyote_over_water (Mozartkugel -> Zuckerschock, walker stomp) up to
# the mill race, then walk on into it without jumping: sunk and dead (1090,
# 2219, 3348; respawn at the start, Normal, with the 150-frame intro).
# GameOver at 3408; START at 3559 restarts Brunnwinkl (not Salzburg, not
# the teaser) with score 0, Oblaten 0, 3 lives.
level  = brunnwinkl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = dies_at frames=1090..1090 event=GameOver event=Respawned deaths=3 no_event=LevelComplete
expect = state=playing stage=brunnwinkl score=0 oblaten=0 lives=3 player_x>=34
